        "text": "I have read and Personal Ship Pilot understand the Last Name First Name Type N-number Certificate # LOA procedures MacMonagle Dan ASW 20 N747EA 3712364 yes Pauley Jess ASH 31 Mi N898MM 3399690 y Kelley Peter Discus CS N416HG 4043971 y"
